<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch NIB appoints agent in Norway.</title>
<headline>Dutch NIB appoints agent in Norway.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch Nationale Investeringsbank NV (NIB) said on Tuesday it would appoint Capital International AS (CIAS) as its representative for cross-border banking services in Norway.</p>
<p>The activities will focus on financing shipping companies and off-shore firms and there will be an active cooperation with other banks operating in the same sector, NIB said.</p>
<p>NIB had a total shipping finance portfolio of 1.9 billion guilders by the end of last year, 0.5 billion of which was generated in Norway and the other Scandinavian countries.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
